---
title: Flowchart 3 – Escrow hold states
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : hold created (booking seat or bill)
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> AUTHORIZED : paid on Safepay checkout
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> VOIDED : booking cancelled / guests arrived
  AUTHORIZED --> VOIDED : void (cancel, arrival)
  AUTHORIZED --> IN_ESCROW : capture (no-show seat, admin capture)
  [*] --> IN_ESCROW : dinner bill at check-in
  IN_ESCROW --> RELEASED : release → payout to restaurant
  IN_ESCROW --> REFUNDED : refund to Mingler
  AUTHORIZED --> FAILED : Safepay refuses
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> FAILED : no-show but no card added
  FAILED --> IN_ESCROW : Retry succeeds
  FAILED --> VOIDED : Close with note
  RELEASED --> [*]
  REFUNDED --> [*]
  VOIDED --> [*]
  note right of FAILED : not a hold status — a row in\npayment_failures shown under\nFinances → Failed collections
